[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307973725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3307973725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3307973725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FK6xd","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T15:00:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T15:00:11Z","body":"The (*) in the window title not clearing does cause the editor to prompt a save on exit, even if you literally did just save.\n\n<img width=\"489\" height=\"206\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f50fdaf-b485-48f2-b6b7-256beda20eda\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3307973725/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308139894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3308139894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3308139894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FLjV2","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T15:30:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T14:05:50Z","body":"Further observations:\n\n\"save all scenes\" does not work unless at least one scene has unsaved changes. And there are cases in which you, can not use it, even when there are. *1\n\n\"save scene\" always works, even if there are not unsaved changes at all.\n\nThis is also indicated by the menu options in the Scene menu. *1 I am uncertain right now if that is reflected in the menu.\n\n---\n\nFurther observations:\n\nOnce a failure state is achieved, the shortcut will not function even if:\n\nThe scene dock is focused. The main view is changed from script to 2d/3d.\n\nOnly once I've interacted with the toolbar menus will it work again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308139894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315102525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3315102525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3315102525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmHM9","user":{"login":"belzecue","id":1931303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzEzMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1931303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue","html_url":"https://github.com/belzecue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T16:53:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T18:47:47Z","body":"It's a weird change in behaviour.  I noticed it today after doing several hours of work in 4.5.  Normally (previously with 4.4.x), if I'm editing a script and it gets the 'changed' asterix, I hit CTRL+SHIFT+ALT+S and the editor saves all changed open scripts.\n\nI was doing that by muscle memory and kept getting 's' appended to my script code here and there and at first thought something had broken with my Debian/xfce and shortcuts.  But then I noticed the SCENE > SAVE ALL SCENES menu item was greyed out when it would typically be active.\n\nThat is obviously not correct behaviour: when a menu item is greyed out, hitting the shortcut key combo should NOT let an alpha key through to the editor.  For example, when REDO in the menu is greyed out, hitting CTL+SHIFT+Z should not let the letter 'z' leak through into the code editor code.  And yet that's what's happening now for me in 4.5 with SAVE ALL SCENES and its shortcut CTRL+SHIFT+ALT+S: if SAVE ALL SCENES is greyed out, hitting that shortcut combo sends the letter 's' to the code editor.  However: I tested on my Windows 10 box and I don't get the same 's' key leakage using the same repro method, so it might just be affecting my Debian Linux box.\n\nI opened the same project in 4.4.1 and observed that SAVE ALL SCENES menu item is indeed active all the time, like TheDuriel points out above.  CTRL+SHIFT+ALT+S works as expected in 4.4.1 on the same Linux box, so I don't believe the 's' character leakage is due to something at my end.\n\nI'm not set up to bisect right now, but looking at changes for 4.5, these (not an exhaustive search) touched SAVE ALL SCENES:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106714/files\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102990/files\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103695/files\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90034/files\n\nI'll gather more info and probably open my own issue for this, because I'm not sure mine is closely related to TheDuriel's -- other than being related to the SAVE ALL SCENES editor function.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315102525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491263628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3491263628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3491263628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QGHSM","user":{"login":"Saikano-droid","id":188491684,"node_id":"U_kgDOCzwnpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188491684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid","html_url":"https://github.com/Saikano-droid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saikano-droid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T13:36:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T13:36:12Z","body":"Can confirm the same issue on Windows 11. The Save All Scenes shortcut rarely works after 4.5 update. Afaik the menu item works fine every time you click on it. \n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491263628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3642024870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3642024870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3642024870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZFOOm","user":{"login":"KerimcanUzar","id":25204054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA0MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25204054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar","html_url":"https://github.com/KerimcanUzar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerimcanUzar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-11T13:49:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T13:49:23Z","body":"The issue persists on 4.6 Beta as well. While closing it throws \"Save modified resources before closing?\" repeatedly and infinitely.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3642024870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764042112","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3764042112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3764042112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gWrmA","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T15:49:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T15:49:53Z","body":"The shortcuts of 'Save All Scenes' and 'Script Editor > Save All' need be set to the same to reproduce it as I tried.\nIt's more of saving all editing files with one shortcut instead of shortcut not working, if I understand correctly.\nThe default shortcuts(`Ctrl+Alt+Shift+S` and `Alt+Shift+S`) on 4.5.1-stable and 4.6-rc1 would save all scenes and all scripts at once in the script editor view or 2D editor as tested.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764042112/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764065325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3764065325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3764065325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gWxQt","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T16:11:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T16:11:52Z","body":"As mentioned, invoking saving through the UI also produce inconsistent results. It's not a conflict in the key bindings, but a problem with how godot determines that it needs to save AND with how shortcut focus works.\n\nAs it stands: \"Save all scenes\" sometimes does not save **any** scenes. And it **never** saves scripts.\n\nThis is a bug, and a regression, both individually.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764065325/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3872745247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-3872745247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":3872745247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7m1Wcf","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T16:22:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T16:22:40Z","body":"Confirming that the behavior persists in v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n\n\"Save All Scenes\" in the shortcut map, bound to ctrl+s (physical), will **sometimes** not work:\n\n* When the Script editor is open and focused\n* Or when the Script editor is open and the Scene dock is focused\n* Or when the 2D editor is open and focused\n\nSaving via the menu option does work. However I am frequently asked about saving open resources when I want to quit the editor. Despite no visible asterix in the window title, and repeated attempts to use the shortcut.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3872745247/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275783784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-4275783784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":4275783784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-20ho","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T11:19:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T11:19:04Z","body":"Once again confirming the behavior.\n\n<img width=\"901\" height=\"711\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5902bfe4-39bb-4326-bb1e-a77c75c79753\" />\n\nSteps to reproduce saving not happening:\n\n1. Open scene\n2. Move node\n3. Click on 2D/3D editor just to be 100% sure it's in focus\n4. ctrl+s\n5. Nothing is saved, asterisk remains, you can click on any part of the editor, tab in out etc, nothing changes.\n6. Use Scene>SaveAllScenes menu option\n7. Observe saving, asterisk clears\n8. Click on 2D/3D editor again\n9. ctrl+s\n10. Observe that saving progress bar appears despite there being no unsaved changes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275783784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4296570245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110660#issuecomment-4296570245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110660","id":4296570245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABABh1hQ","user":{"login":"Poobslag","id":5902413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDI0MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5902413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag","html_url":"https://github.com/Poobslag","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Poobslag/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T13:24:57Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T13:24:57Z","body":"To compound on this strangeness:\n\n<img width=\"371\" height=\"251\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cba8f51c-9cb1-42fb-b70c-f275481f1975\" />\n\n1. The Scene menu has a \"Save All Scenes\" menu item which is greyed out if there are no changes\n\n<img width=\"427\" height=\"176\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bcbf8e8-d700-422f-ad9d-a694a9170236\" />\n\n2. Right-clicking a scene tab opens a context with a different \"Save All Scenes\" menu item which is never greyed out\n3. In both cases, scenes can still be saved one-at-a-time, you just cannot save all of them.\n\nOne might wonder \"Why do you want to save a scene with no changes?\" but this is a good way to fix invalid UID warnings.","author_as